    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>Chayce Properties arranges downsizing help, careful packing, fully insured removals for older people and settling-in support in {{ area.name }}, {{ area.county }}, with one dedicated coordinator. We are based in Northampton, and {{ area.name }} is {{ area.distance }} {{ area.direction }} of our office. Packages start from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
