<section class="rx-band" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl area.heroImage %});{% imageSet area.heroImage %}">
  <div class="container"><span class="gd-eyebrow">One coordinator</span><h2>Your move in {{ area.name }}, <em font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-light)>looked after from start to finish.</em></h2><p>We help older people and their families with downsizing, packing, removals and settling in when leaving a long-held home, whether that is a move within {{ area.name }} or to another part of the UK. One dedicated coordinator looks after the whole journey, so you are not juggling several separate companies.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Planning your move</span><h2>Planning elderly removals <em>in {{ area.name }}</em></h2></div>
    <ol class="rx-tips" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px">
      {% for item in area.planFor %}<li><span class="rx-tn">0{{ loop.index }}</span><p>{{ item }}</p></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="rx-cap" style="text-align:center;max-width:820px">A move in {{ area.name }} falls under {{ area.council }}. You can find your local council, and its adult social care services, on <a href="https://www.gov.uk/find-local-council" rel="noopener">GOV.UK</a>.</p>
    <p class="rx-cap" style="text-align:center;max-width:820px;margin-top:10px">Where to start: <a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">downsizing help for older people</a>, <a href="/storage-during-your-move/">storage between house moves</a>, <a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">moving an elderly parent</a>, <a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">what an elderly move manager does</a> and our <a href="/services/">services</a>. See also <a href="/elderly-removals-northampton/">elderly removals in Northampton</a> and <a href="/areas-we-cover/">all the areas we cover</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Elderly removals in {{ area.name }}: <em>frequently asked questions</em></h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>{{ area.faqTitle }}</summary><p>{{ area.faqAnswer }}</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer downsizing help for older people in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. We help older people in {{ area.name }} decide what to keep, sell or pass on, pack with care, arrange the removal and settle in at the new home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does a move from {{ area.name }} cost?</summary><p>Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} for packing and removals, with full-service moves from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }} and gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to anything.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What does an elderly move manager do in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>An elderly move manager plans and coordinates a later-life move from start to finish. In {{ area.name }}, Chayce provides this with one dedicated coordinator for sorting, packing, the removal and settling in. See <a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">what an elderly move manager does</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer removals for elderly people in {{ area.name }}?</summary><p>Yes. Removals for older people are part of our service in {{ area.name }}. Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, and a dedicated coordinator looks after the whole move.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are your staff DBS-checked?</summary><p>Yes. See our <a href="/trust-and-safeguarding/">trust and safeguarding page</a> for how we protect clients.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-teaser">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="panel">
      <span class="home-eyebrow">Our packages</span>
      <h2>Choose the <em>level of removals and downsizing help</em> you need</h2>
      <p>From an hour&rsquo;s planning to a complete, coordinated move, with packages starting from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}.</p>
      <ul class="pkg-links"><li><a href="/discovery/">Discovery Consultation</a></li><li><a href="/bronze-essentials/">Bronze Essentials</a></li><li><a href="/silver-comfort/">Silver Comfort</a></li></ul>
      <a class="explore" href="/packages/">Compare all packages &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<p class="pg-note">Our office is at Unit F2B Barratt House, Kingsthorpe Road, Northampton NN2 6EZ, open {{ site.openingHoursText }}. Call <a href="tel:+447708925432">{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a> or email {{ site.email }} to arrange a phone consultation or a visit.</p>

